       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TBLIDX1.
       AUTHOR. SYNTHETIC-CORPUS.
      * CATEGORY B: DATA FEATURES - OCCURS TABLE WITH INDEXED ARRAY DATA
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  SALES-DATA-TABLE.
           05  MONTHLY-SALES-BUCKET OCCURS 12 TIMES.
               10  MONTH-NAME          PIC X(9).
               10  REVENUE-AMOUNT      PIC 9(7)V99.
               10  UNITS-SOLD          PIC 9(5).
       01  TABLE-TOTALS.
           05  ANNUAL-TOTAL-REVENUE    PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 000000000.00.
           05  ANNUAL-TOTAL-UNITS      PIC 9(7) VALUE 0000000.
           05  MAX-MONTHLY-REVENUE     PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0000000.00.
           05  TOP-MONTH-NAME          PIC X(9) VALUE SPACES.
           05  CURRENT-IDX             PIC 9(2) VALUE 1.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-PROCESS-SALES-TABLE.
           PERFORM 1000-INITIALIZE-TABLE
           PERFORM 2000-AGGREGATE-TOTALS
           GOBACK.

       1000-INITIALIZE-TABLE.
           MOVE 'JANUARY' TO MONTH-NAME(1)
           MOVE 12000.00 TO REVENUE-AMOUNT(1)
           MOVE 150 TO UNITS-SOLD(1)
           MOVE 'FEBRUARY' TO MONTH-NAME(2)
           MOVE 14500.00 TO REVENUE-AMOUNT(2)
           MOVE 180 TO UNITS-SOLD(2)
           MOVE 'MARCH' TO MONTH-NAME(3)
           MOVE 22000.00 TO REVENUE-AMOUNT(3)
           MOVE 270 TO UNITS-SOLD(3)
           MOVE 'APRIL' TO MONTH-NAME(4)
           MOVE 19800.00 TO REVENUE-AMOUNT(4)
           MOVE 230 TO UNITS-SOLD(4).

       2000-AGGREGATE-TOTALS.
           PERFORM VARYING CURRENT-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL CURRENT-IDX > 4
               COMPUTE ANNUAL-TOTAL-REVENUE = ANNUAL-TOTAL-REVENUE + REVENUE-AMOUNT(CURRENT-IDX)
               COMPUTE ANNUAL-TOTAL-UNITS = ANNUAL-TOTAL-UNITS + UNITS-SOLD(CURRENT-IDX)
               IF REVENUE-AMOUNT(CURRENT-IDX) > MAX-MONTHLY-REVENUE
                   MOVE REVENUE-AMOUNT(CURRENT-IDX) TO MAX-MONTHLY-REVENUE
                   MOVE MONTH-NAME(CURRENT-IDX) TO TOP-MONTH-NAME
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM.
